window.products.push({"id":1007050,"name":"KOMOREBI Pastel Blue Balloons 5 Inch 100pcs Baby Blue Balloons Macaron Blue Light Blue Balloons Latex party balloons for Birthday Engagement Wedding A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610vOV2GawS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Material: Including 100 pieces 5 inch pastel blue balloons.Made of premium natural rubber latex and 20% thicker than average latex party balloons, non-toxic and no strange smell, eco-friendly and biodegradable, durable and not easy to break ,longer lasting. Best Size & Stay Time: These macaron blue balloons can be filled with air or helium.Best size when inflated is 5 inch. Blue balloons filled with air can last three to four days, filled with helium can float for 3-6 hours.For the best floating effect ,fill helium 1-2 hours before your party. Various usage: Pastel blue latex balloons can be used for all indoor and outdoor party decorations.It will definitely be the best choice for your wedding decoration, and great for birthday party, baby shower, anniversary, graduation and other events. It’s also perfect for dressing up kids room and spring garden. If you assort with other color balloons, there will be a different effect in your party, will make your party more special and memorable. Warm Tips: Please inflate balloons to recommended size to avoid deformation or burst.There will be certain color difference after inflation, and the color effect will be better. Please avoid sunburning, overheating, sharp object and excessive friction. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee: We are confident with the pastel color and quality of our light blue balloons. Don’t hesitate, just buy it! If you are not satisfied , please feel free to contact us. We will provide satisfying customer service to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610vOV2GawS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOMOREBI","source_asin":"B09S3CSMY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S3CSMY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S3CSMY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
