window.products.push({"id":1007087,"name":"JennyGems Mimi Gifts, My Biggest Fans Call Me Mimi Wooden Sign, Gift for Mimi, Wall Hanging and Shelf Decor, Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BwwUuMsTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Birthday Gift for Mimi, Mothers Day Gifts for Mimi: This loving sign is a great gift for your Mimi, mother-in-law or mom. Gifts from grandchildren are something that Mimi will cherish forever. Mimi gifts or grandma gifts are great ideas for retirement parties, anniversaries, grandparents day, Mimi's birthday, Mother's Day gifts, Valentine's Day and Easter. About: This Mimi sign reads My Biggest Fans Call Me Mimi and measures 8x6x1.5 inches. It includes a built-in hook for wall hanging. This sign can also stand freely on any tabletop flat surface. Home Decor: This charming Mimi sign will look great with any interior style. Hang this Mimi wall decor with pictures of the grandkids and let it add the finishing touch to a family wall display. Place this sign in your kitchen, living room, desk, end table, nightstand or dresser. Sentiment: Every time your Mimi sees this meaningful decoration, it will be a great reminder of your relationship. A gift for Mimi like this is sure to put a smile on her face. Handmade signs made in the United States by American workers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BwwUuMsTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JennyGems","source_asin":"B07SSDC4PT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SSDC4PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SSDC4PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1007088,"name":"HIC Harold Import Co Citrus Spout Citrus Juicer, 18/8 Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cWdJ1Xh7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIC’s Citrus Spout is a hand juicer, or manual juicer, to easily extract fresh lemon juice, orange juice, lime, and grapefruit, or juice from any other citrus fruits. It’s one of those ‘cool gadgets’ that’s great for food preparation to flavor dishes, sauces, marinades or to mix up fruit juice cocktails, like margaritas, even baking key lime pie! Pass it around at mealtime for fresh lime juice on nachos, lemon juice on fish recipes or fresh squeezed orange juice in iced tea and other refreshing beverages. This manual citrus juicer is much easier to use than a heavy juicer machines or blender. Simply twist the spiral end into the citrus fruit and squeeze the exact amount of juice needed, a little or a lot. Fresh juice will flow from the spout instantly. Made from 18/8 stainless steel, HIC’s Citrus Spout juice extractor is durable, compact for easy storage and easy to clean. Just pop it in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cWdJ1Xh7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B00XCE084E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XCE084E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XCE084E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
