window.products.push({"id":1007097,"name":"MIU Stainless-Steel Battery-Operated Salt and Peppermill Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QHMMVYYGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description With this 2 piece salt and pepper grinder set from MIU France, you will be able to grind salt and/or pepper with one hand. Both the salt grinder and the pepper grinder are made from 18/10 Stainless steel and feature a battery operated electric motor that is activated by pushing a button located on the top of each unit. The salt grinder features a ceramic grinder while the pepper grinder is a stainless steel grinder. You will also see what you are grinding because both units feature a light at the bottom that is activated when the grinding button is pushed. Each unit measures 2\" in diameter and 7.5\" in height. Amazon.com These two handsome mills not only grind salt and pepper quickly and precisely at the touch of a button but add a modern look to a kitchen or table. Both mills look identical-the exterior housing is brushed stainless steel with an acrylic viewing window-but the difference is inside. Since peppercorns are harder than salt crystals, the salt mill contains a ceramic grinder while the peppermill employs a tougher, carbon steel grinding mechanism. Battery-operated, the electric motor inside each mill can be activated with just one hand, eliminating the hard-on-the-wrist twisting that many hand-grinders require. A light comes on automatically at the bottom of each mill to illuminate exactly how much ground pepper or salt is being produced. Each cylinder rotates to either a closed or open position, so that the ground salt or pepper can be contained and used later. The mills measure 7-1/2 by 2 inches, and each requires three AAA batteries for operation. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QHMMVYYGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIU France","source_asin":"B000E5U19Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000E5U19Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000E5U19Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
