window.products.push({"id":1007112,"name":"Pacific Coast Feather Down on Top King Baffle Box Feather Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411PDQW7KJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Create your own cozy bedroom nest with this Down on Top feather bed. The moment you slip into bed, it will contour to your body, cushioning pressure points like shoulders and hips. This gentle feather bed hug helps relax your body and increases circulation. An extra Down on Top layer provides the ultimate in cloud-like comfort. The baffle box design and gussets keep the feathers evenly distributed and fluffy to the very edge. The result is a more restful, comfortable bedroom sanctuary. The 30-Night Comfort Guarantee ensures your comfort. Pacific Coast Feather creates supremely comfortable bedding designed to make a difference in your comfort. You'll experience irresistibly fluffy down and feathers in premier, long-lasting bedding. 100% cotton Barrier Weave fabrics use a tighter weave and special finishing that make them leak-proof, so down won't sneak out. And the unique cleaning method produces Hyperclean down and feathers, which means dust, dirt and allergens have been removed, so you can sleep easy. Indulge yourself and experience a new level of comfort with Pacific Coast Feather bedding. Amazon.com This sumptuous featherbed from Pacific Coast is the final word in bedtime luxury. Its gentle cushioning and soft support will ensure a comfortable and relaxing nights sleep. It's filled with down and feathers that have been selected, sorted, and cleaned by hand to produce fill material that is free of dust, dirt, and allergens. It features an outer shell made from silky, 230-thread-count Barrier Weave cotton, which prevents feathers from leaking out. In order to prevent the down and feathers from shifting around while you sleep, this featherbed has a baffle box design. This design keeps the feathers in place, while allowing them to fully loft. For an added touch of luxury, a layer of down is added to the top of the featherbed. Guaranteed to provide comforting support for many years, this featherbed comes with a 10-year limited warranty. --Susannah Detlef","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411PDQW7KJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Coast Feather","source_asin":"B00009YFVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009YFVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009YFVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
