window.products.push({"id":1007122,"name":"TABYIK Space Heater for Indoor Use, 45°Oscillating Portable Heater, Fast Heating Ceramic Heater Quiet Heat with 7 Safety Protections Small Electric He","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xz5Ky7RyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast Advanced Heating = Equipped with an advanced PTC ceramic heating element and high-speed fan, this space heater blows out tons of heating wind in seconds! This space heater provides faster and more efficient heating than traditional heaters, quickly heating up the air surrounding you to bring you a warm and comfortable experience. Advanced Safety Protections = This is a safe ETL-certified space heater for the whole family and pets, thanks to these safety features as below: 1. V0 Flame Retardant Material: this space heater is made of quality anti-flame material to achieve zero fire hazard. 2. Tip Over Protection: this space heater will auto shut off the heater as soon as it is knocked over, to provent accidents. 3. Overheating Protection: the sensor inside this space heater will auto shut off the heater once the heating module overheats. 4. Cool Down Feature: after you turn off the space heater, the program of this space heater will cool down the heating module with 15s natural wind, to extend its serving life. 5. Anti-scald Net: this space heater with a quality anti-scald net could stop accidents touch to the heating module, to greatly protect your kids and pets. 6. Dual Switches Design: to prevent possible wrong operations by kids, this space heater is designed with a physical button and a touching button, to control the power ON/OFF. You need to press one by one to turn on the space heater. Cozy Heating = This space heater with a dustproof foam grid behind it offers you the cleaning heating wind. The 45° Oscillation feature covers a wider area surrounding you and prevents the too-dry problem for your skin too. More Warmth & Less Noise = differs from those noisy heater fans stealing your good night's sleep, this space heater is equipped with an advanced motor and quiet fan, less than 40dB, so you could use it in a bedroom while sleeping without any disturbance. Dual Winds = Not only blow out the heating wind but this space heater could also be used as a natural wind fan. Save Money & Save Trouble = This compact and exquisite space heater is ideal for personal warming, meant to sit by your feet on the floor, near your hands on a desk, or carry around your bedroom (built-in handle), living room, kitchen, and office. This space heater helps to save your bill by heating up your surrounding space instead of heating the whole house with other centralized heaters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xz5Ky7RyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TABYIK","source_asin":"B0BLH64CZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLH64CZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLH64CZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
