window.products.push({"id":1007578,"name":"AKIRAKOKI Electric Burr Coffee Grinder with Multi Grind Settings, Portable Small Conical Stainless Steel Precision Forged Burr Grinder for Coffee Bean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jQjaRupiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ 【Precision Grinding Settings】Electric coffee grinder with Stainless Steel Precision Forged Burr Grinder, Stainless Steel burr will not add heat during grinding, more precise than blade grinder, the strong and original aroma of coffee can be maintained, and the coffee flavor is better. The burr coffee grinder ​can grind up to 1 ounce/30 grams (4 - 6 cups) of coffee beans in a single batch. Best choice of coffee lover. ☕ 【Adjustable grinding settings】Coffee grinder built-in adjustable grind selector, burr grinder ​can be adjustable to achieve any desired size by simply turning the grind knob. Enjoy the different textures and coffee styles right from the comforts of your kitchen! Espresso, Drip Coffee, French Press, Cold Brew, Herb, or Spices and the likes all at your fingertip. ☕ 【Easy To Clean】Upper chamber, container, and the grinding burr mill inside the machine can be removed, really easy to clean. Included cleaning brush, after you grind the coffee beans or spices, you can also use the cleaning brush to clean the inside of the coffee grinders. ☕ 【Compact & Stylish】This espresso grinder takes up minimal counter space and can be easily stored in cabinets and drawers. The electric coffee grinder adopts USB-C rechargeable design, bid farewell to the trouble of inconvenient no portability of traditional plug-in type. Put the compact conical burr grinder into your suitcase, and enjoy the quality coffee when traveling. ☕ 【More Quiet Grinding】Our coffee grinder is quieter than other coffee grinders on the market. When you grind freshly ground coffee in the morning, you don’t have to worry about making too much noise and disturbing your family. The package includes 1 * electric coffee grinder, 1 * USB charging cable, 1 * brush for cleaning and 1 * user's manual. It is not only the best gift for coffee lovers but also an ideal great gift for parents, partners, and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jQjaRupiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKIRAKOKI","source_asin":"B09RN8K34D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RN8K34D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RN8K34D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
