window.products.push({"id":1007616,"name":"NohaRin 12x15 inch Simple Style Wood Picture Frames Made to Display Pictures 11x14 Without Mat or 8x12 With Mat, With Wall Mounting Materials, Cherry ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MaM7CPciL._AC_.jpg","description":"1. This is a kind of all solid wood environmental protection picture frame. The border is sprayed with three layers high grade matte PU environmental protection paint, no additional chemical or industrial materials . 2. Wall Mounting Material Include Black S hook and White non-trace nail. 3. The black S hook has been installed on the back of the photo frame. When Hanging the photo frame. Break open the sawtooth iron of the balck S hook to 45 degrees with your hand , to be able to hook the protruding tail of the white non-trace nail conveniently. 4. The white non-trace nail is in the extra small plastic bag. It has three thin needles and one protuberant tail. The needle must point to the metope, pay attention to direction and safety . The three thin needles were nailed to the wall without a trace, which was easy and firm. The protruding tail is used to hook the black S hook on the back of the frame, conveniently and quickly. 5. It can be used for matting photos, art, and needlepoint. Also great for crafts, backboards, signs, children's projects, and school projects. Good photo frame Solutions in gallery. 6. Three dimension suggests that in turn: The size of the casing outside the poster frame. The picture size without mat . The picture size with mat . 7. The double sided of acrylic sheet cover with protective film, Please torn off when use! 8. Mat is a kind of inside lining paper of print frame, mainly has the effect of ornament, foil, rendering, increase the stereo feeling. 9.Frame border: 2 cm wide and 2 cm thick. 10. All size is measured by hand, 2-3 mm error. 11. You can buy LanDing glues to deal with walls with different materials and roughness. such as not smooth hard stone, elegant wallpaper, soft limestone, latex, etc. The viscous force of LanDing glues is very strong, and do not adsorb the wall when take off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MaM7CPciL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NohaRin","source_asin":"B073GL47CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073GL47CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073GL47CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
