window.products.push({"id":1007699,"name":"Native Coral Honeysuckle (Lonicera sempervirens)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uG58axf5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Another Native! The Native Honyesuckle\"s are petite and polite. Never devouring a landscape. Lovely companions to Clematis. This \"No Name\" Coral has a foliage like \" John Clayton \" but the intense red flowering-plants of \" Major Wheeler \" , spring to early summer in the North. 3-6\" tall. Full sun North of St. Louis, Louie- to full shade or morning sun in the sizzling South. Start a honeysuckle collection now! Semi evergreen. Zone 4-8. Please be aware that plants shipped between November and April will be shipped dormant. These plants will have no foliage, they are dormant in winter. Here in TN they don't emerge till Spring arrives and die back to the ground at the first frost. All our plants are grown in real time outside, not in greenhouses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uG58axf5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExtraDisist","source_asin":"B002XAT858","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002XAT858","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002XAT858","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
