window.products.push({"id":1007785,"name":"TCDesignerProducts Blue Iridescent Cracked Ice Textured Streamer Roll, 2 Inches x 75 Feet, Wedding Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MBkReKd7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Your wedding day should be as fun and unique as you are, and the right wedding decorations can help you achieve a memorable, one-of-a-kind look for your big day. This Blue Iridescent Cracked Ice Textured Streamer Roll is an easy way to add fun pops of color and a cool, textured look to your wedding day decorations. The Cracked Ice Decorating Streamer is made of shiny iridescent PVC, measures 2\" wide x 75' long, and features a pebble-like finish that glitters under lights. The fun textured ribbon makes it easy to DIY and quickly create a memorable, professionally-decorated look for your bridal shower, rehearsal dinner, groom's dinner, bachelorette party, cocktail hour, wedding reception, or wedding brunch. Swoop it from pews or chairs at the ceremony to designate reserved seats for special family or friends, or use it to accent bridal and wedding party flower bouquets. Wrap it around table edges or hang it as fun fringe to dress up the head table, guest tables, dessert and cake tables, guest book table, and gift table. This fancy iridescent blue streamer ribbon also makes a beautiful gift wrap accent for wedding party gifts and a fun addition to wedding favors and table centerpieces. Use it to add interest and depth to structures like arches, gazebos, pergolas, arbors, and columns, and hang it from the ceiling or on a wall to create a unique photo backdrop for wedding party and guest photos. The shiny decorating streamer is ideal for creating a fun and jazzy look for all kinds of other events, too, including birthday parties, anniversary celebrations, baby showers, Quinceañeras, New Year's Eve parties, Christmas and holiday parties, graduations, prom, school dances, fundraisers, banquets, special dinners, community events, and more. Match the textured blue streamers to your nautical wedding colors, beach wedding colors, winter wedding colors, gender reveal party colors, or event theme colors to give your event a coordinated look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MBkReKd7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TCDesignerProducts","source_asin":"B07MQ75NDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MQ75NDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MQ75NDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
