window.products.push({"id":1007944,"name":"jicnuNYS One Way Window Film, Privacy Film See Out Not In Daytime Sun Blocking Heat Control Anti UV Static Non-Adhesive Reflective Tinting for Home an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j6ug7P-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEATURES: Highly-reflective material provides superior daytime privacy while maintaining your view of the outside. This upgraded film can block most of the sun, reflect 99% of UV rays and 85% of infrared rays and increased interior comfort. The new strong glue design will help the mirror window film cling on the window surface firmly and make it available for long time use. Installation Instructions: 1. Measure the surface and cut the film. Leave an extra inch margin on each side for an easy adjustment. 2. Thoroughly clean the target surface to ensure that the surface is clean enough. 3. Peel off the transparent backing film along a short side. 4. Spray a lot of water both on the adhesive side and window surface (Very Important!!!), then apply the film to the window. 5. use a squeegee to flatten the film gently and out bubbles little by little. 6. Trim off the margins and use a cloth to flatten out the film. Here you go! Package Includes: 1x One Way Window Film Privacy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j6ug7P-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jicnuNYS","source_asin":"B09WDY6FXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDY6FXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDY6FXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1007945,"name":"LEAFOR Pizza Peel, Pizza Cutter with Cover and Pizza Spatula. Pizza Paddle Foldable, Premium Aluminum, Black, Easy to store - Easy to clean. Pizza Ove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tdsAG4XeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SERVE PIZZA LIKE A PRO – This set includes a pizza paddle, a pizza cutter with cover and a pizza spatula, all made with a nonstick coating that makes slicing and serving pizza a lovely experience. These pizza accessories are suitable for anyone who loves pizza because it makes the process of making pizza safe and easier than ever. QUALITY – This pizza cooker set is amazing! The metal pizza peel 12 inch is made with high-quality commercial-grade aluminum and stainless steel, so it is extremely durable and resistant. The pizza board is easy to clean. The mezzaluna knife smooth easily through your pizza deep dish or thin crust. Finally, the pizza spatula is well finished to serve pizza with confidence. COMPACT DESIGN – The pizza spatula paddle is 12 inch when folded and 24 inch when extended, our wide pie pizza peel makes it easy to get your pizza in and out of the oven, to enjoy a pizza party. The pizza shovel features a sturdy wooden handle for a comfortable grip to keep your hands safe and away from the heat and a rope to hang it up. The foldable handle makes the pizza press easy to store. WIDE APPLICATIONS – Practice pizza or picking up a cake, bread or some pastries. This pizza kit to make at home will help you get the job done with ease. The pizza board with handle for oven is perfect for use indoor or outdoor, whether you are a pizza oven camp chef or just someone who loves to bake. This super peel 12 inch is extremely versatile unlike other pizza peels such as a wooden pizza paddle. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE – The product packaging is sturdy and easily recyclable, and the product itself is oriented to an eco-friendly environment. You can feel good about using this product, knowing that you are helping to make the world a better place. Plus, our commercial pizza press serving set is made to last, so you can use them again and again without replacing it. PIZZA SPATULA – Nice bonus always useful. After transfer from your pizza paddle 12 inch and cut your pizza or any pastry with the rocker cutter, the spatula completes your pizza accessories and supplies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tdsAG4XeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leafor","source_asin":"B09WTDPGBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1007945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WTDPGBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WTDPGBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
